		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant, 10-legged spider with three barbed scorpion tails and a dozen blue-grey tentacles instead of a head.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 sting +7 (2d6 + shred) and 3 tentacles (near) +7 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Horrific Appearance</strong>. Mortal creatures looking directly at qlippoth, CON 15+ or 1d4 CHA damage. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shred</strong>. Deals an extra 2d6 damage if it hits the same target with all three stings.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
